-- title: Atlas certificate expiring
-- severity: Medium
-- host: {atlas_url}
-- region: all
-- minimum_days_left: 14
-- timeout: 10
-- pending_for: 900
-- resolve_after: 1800
-- runbook_url: https://github.com/frappe/atlas/blob/develop/beacon/runbooks/atlas-certificate.md
-- Beacon reads the certificate that the Atlas API serves. Central calls this API for every server action.
